  nodes:
  - npcText: 'Stranger. We welcome you in our inter-galactic quantum-randomized casino. '
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: You are not on our previous guest-list. Let us introduce you to the
      rules of our casino game.
    options:
    - text: Go on.
      nextNode: 2
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: We play with all the points on your account, with sum of digits to be
      more precise. For example, if your current points are 16,765 then the sum is
      1+6+7+6+5 = 25
    options:
    - text: And then what?
      nextNode: 3
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: 'Then we summon our quantum-randomizer to determine the condition of
      your victory: either sum is odd, even or divisible by 3 or 5. If sum responds
      to summoned condition then you win. If it does not, we win.'
    options:
    - text: How am I supposed to trust computer in randomisation?
      nextNode: 4
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Are not you trusting computers all the time? Anyway, if you win we x1.5
      your points. And if you lose we take half of everything you have. Oh. And if
      you end up with less than 2,000 points we won't take your points. We just will
      take your spaceship.
    options:
    - text: What? How am I supposed to destroy asteroids then?
      nextNode: 5
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: No worries. We will give you our spare ship. It does the job. But you
      are not welcome in casino while on this ship. So, all clear or we should repeat
      the rules?
    options:
    - text: 'All clear. '
      nextNode: 10
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
    - text: Repeat please
      nextNode: 6
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: We play with all the points on your account, with sum of digits to be
      more precise. For example, if your current points are 16,765 then the sum is
      1+6+7+6+5 = 25
    options:
    - text: Okay.
      nextNode: 7
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: 'Then we summon our quantum-randomizer to determine the condition of
      your victory: either sum is odd, even or divisible by 3 or 5. If sum reponds
      to summoned condition then you win. If it does not, we win.'
    options:
    - text: 'Mkay. '
      nextNode: 8
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: If you win we x1.5 your points. And if you lose we take half of everything
      you have.
    options:
    - text: 'Mkay. '
      nextNode: 9
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: And if you have less than 2,000 points we won't take your points. We
      just will take your spaceship and give you spare one. Should we repeat or all
      clear?
    options:
    - text: All clear.
      nextNode: 10
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
    - text: 'Repeat please. '
      nextNode: 6
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Should we play?
    options:
    - text: Yes.
      nextNode: 11
      updatesPlanetNode: 1
      newPlanetNode: 10
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
    - text: No.
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: And so we summon inter-galactic quantum-randomizer! Randomizer says
      that we check whether your point's digits are...
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 0
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: RANDOMIZER
  - npcText: '... odd! Well, you... '
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 0
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_ODD
  - npcText: '... even! And you have... '
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 0
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_EVEN
  - npcText: ... divisible by 3. So...
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 0
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_DIVISIBLE3
  - npcText: '... divisible by 5. You... '
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 0
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 1
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_DIVISIBLE5
  - npcText: '.. won! Well... wanna try again? '
    options:
    - text: Yes!
      nextNode: 11
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_ODD
    - text: 'Maybe next time. '
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_ODD
  - npcText: '.. lost... and your ship is now ours. Come again when you have points
      or some proper ship. '
    options:
    - text: Damn.
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_ODD
  - npcText: .. lost... still have some points though. Want to try again?
    options:
    - text: 'You know... I better go. '
      nextNode: -1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: RANDOMIZER_ODD
    - text: Yeah, let's try!
      nextNode: 11
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: 'This is a casino, you know. Get more than 2000 points to enter. '
